  "body": "Most brand-new homes give you shiny finishes and a postage-stamp section. This one gives you the full family upgrade: 626m² freehold land, approx. 228m² of brand-new luxury living, 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, multiple living zones, a real backyard, and the comfort package already built in. Big land, big layout, big family energy — ready to move in now.\r\n\r\nWhy This One Feels Different\r\n\r\n• 626m² freehold section — rare space for a brand-new home\r\n\r\n• Approx. 228m² floor area — not cramped, not compromised\r\n\r\n• Built by Mars Living Construction\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and multiple living areas\r\n\r\n• Downstairs bedroom with ensuite — perfect for grandparents, guests, teenagers or working from home\r\n\r\n• Upstairs family lounge opening straight to the outdoor entertaining area and backyard\r\n\r\n• Central air-conditioning with individual room controls\r\n\r\n• Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Bosch kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• Brand-new and ready to move in\r\n\r\nMade for Families Who Need More Than “Just Enough”\r\n\r\nDownstairs gives you the flexibility families actually need — a private ensuite bedroom, generous everyday living, quality kitchen space and easy internal-access garaging. It works for extended family, guests, older kids or anyone who wants space without being stuck upstairs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is where the home gets even better. A second family lounge opens directly to the outdoor entertaining area and spacious backyard, giving you that rare indoor-outdoor flow most new builds only pretend to have. Kids outside, parents relaxed, guests entertained — this is how family living should feel.\r\n\r\nComfort Is Already Sorted\r\n\r\nNo fighting over the heat pump. No freezing bathroom floors. Central air-conditioning with individual room controls keeps every room comfortable, while underfloor heating brings that little bit of daily luxury where it matters most.\r\n\r\nThe Real Reason To Move Fast\r\n\r\nNew builds are everywhere. New builds on 626m² of freehold land are not.\r\n\r\nIf you want a brand-new home with proper space, a real backyard, flexible family living and quality comfort features in sought-after Orewa, this is the one worth seeing before another family gets there first.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa today to arrange your viewing.",
